06003", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340705_1281429302239336_4781847839353527208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=594QmARNmqcQ7kNvwFBKP6g&_nc_oc=AdrZBoF7ck6SC2PQKPz0Y99hdSdWfpVYyM0YupnPggrSu39SzX7ym2iWkJxRZ9-Yxf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIIFOwDwiyCHZXzAH_eiApFjN7mQDuWnt4BRowLQX8iw&oe=6AFC8884"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Drops Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DROPS VR is an initiative by the DROPS Asia Chapter administered by Drilling VR to create a free Virtual Reality based awareness training and collaboration tool.\n\nStudents will learn through a series of real world simulated assignments to\n\n - Understand the potential of dropped objects\n - Recognize common causes of dropped objects\n - Methods for preventing dropped objects and preventing harm\n - Become familiar with reference tools and publications of the DROPS Forum\n\nDROPS is all about collaboration and the DROPS VR will be a tool where members can\n\n - Virtually remotely meet in a range of Industrial simulated environments\n - Interact with the Virtual Environment by pointing at and moving objects\n - Speak with each other through a multiplayer avatar system\n - Designed for subject matter experts to meet and collaborate for the prevention of dropped objects", "short_description": "Virtual Reality environment to learn about dropped object prevention."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dropsvr.org/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Drilling VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dropsvr.org/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_typ